&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The Account Management team is a critical component of our go-to-market strategy and presents an outstanding opportunity to work on strategic sales cycles with a customer base representing the largest organizations in the Nordics region.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As part of Miro’s Enterprise sales team, you will have the opportunity to develop, strategize, negotiate and close business with some of the Nordics’s largest multinationals. You will work in collaboration with our Customer Success and New Logo team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Large Enterprise Account Executive you will focus on on landing new business and expanding our largest Nordic region accounts by focusing on net new lines of business. You will join a highly motivated, energetic sales team that takes pride in growing deep customer relationships, running strategic sales cycles and delivering the Miro value proposition to a diverse base of accounts across various industries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for an ambitious and organized professional who will drive expansion in our accounts by creating net new progress in our install base today. You will be skilled at using research to gain insight into customer challenges, identifying key stakeholders, calling high and challenging customers&#39; thinking about how Miro can act as a pillar for the way work gets done.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our goal is to create great customer experiences by being Miro product experts and consulting with customers to identify the needs and pain points.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine the interests of multiple client stakeholders to drive account revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic account planning to motivate and lead company resources in appropriate expansion strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break into new personas and lines of business to drive incremental use cases&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a key component in ensuring we have accurate data in our CRM to drive the strategy for our future growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve monthly/quarterly quotas of pipeline and closed business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of sales experience within the Nordics enterprise market, including experience with SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong account expansion skills (new business, strategic territory &amp;amp; account planning, cross functional team-selling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceeding sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English, with fluency in Swedish or Norwegian considered a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to build rapport and relationships with senior clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a great attitude that can manoeuvre through ambiguity and ability to work and collaborative with a growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a results-oriented individual who is excited by the prospect of fueling the continued growth and success of Miro by growing our sales pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a “can do” attitude and are relentless in pursuing goals and solving problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want you to feel supported, connected, and ready to grow. Our global benefits package generally includes equity, a wellbeing benefit, a WFH equipment allowance, and an annual Learning &amp;amp; Development stipend. Join a diverse team where you can do your best work. Full benefits may differ per location. If you would like to learn more about location-specific benefits, please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVG8Fi8Yc=/?moveToWidget=3458764661021134968&amp;amp;cot=10&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Global Miro benefits board&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #f9f6f0;&quot;&gt;#LI-ET1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Miro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Miro is a visual workspace for innovation that enables distributed teams of any size to build the next big thing. The platform&#39;s infinite canvas enables teams to lead engaging workshops and meetings, design products, brainstorm ideas, and more. Miro, co-headquartered in San Francisco and Amsterdam, serves more than 100M users and 250,000 companies collaborate in the Innovation Workspace. Miro was founded in 2011 and currently has more than 1,600 employees in 13 hubs around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are a team of dreamers. We look for individuals who dream big, work hard, and above all stay humble. Collaboration is at the heart of what we do and through our work together we hope to create a supportive, welcoming, and innovative environment. We strive to play as a team to win the world and create a better version of ourselves every day. If this sounds like something that excites you, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out more about life at Miro:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Youtube:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Blog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Instagram: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&quot;&gt;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Miro, we strive to create and foster an environment of belonging and collaboration across cultural differences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Miro’s mission — &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Empower teams to create the next big thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; — is how we think about our product, people, and culture. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe that creating big things requires diverse and inclusive teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites all talent with different demography, identities and styles &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;to step in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites them to step &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;closer together. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, we are working to build a more diverse Miro, cultivate a sense of belonging for future and current Mironeers around the world, and foster an environment where everyone can collaborate and embrace differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miro handles and uses personal data of job applicants in line with its &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; found &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Black Duck Software, Inc. helps organizations build secure, high-quality software, minimizing risks while maximizing speed and productivity. Black Duck, a recognized pioneer in application security, provides SAST, SCA, and DAST solutions that enable teams to quickly find and fix vulnerabilities and defects in proprietary code, open source components, and application behavior. With a combination of industry-leading tools, services, and expertise, only Black Duck helps organizations maximize security and quality in DevSecOps and throughout the software development life cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager, Professional Services – EMEA, you will lead Black Duck&#39;s regional Professional Services team, responsible for helping customers successfully adopt and operationalize application security solutions. You will manage a team of Implementation Consultants who transform customer investments in Black Duck technology into measurable business and security outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines people leadership, customer engagement, operational management, and business partnership. You will work closely with Sales, Customer Success, Technical Account Managers, Product, Support, and Services leadership to ensure exceptional customer experiences while building a high-performing and scalable services organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this is a leadership position, it is not a purely managerial role. The successful candidate will remain actively engaged with customers, supporting strategic initiatives, executive relationships, complex delivery programmes, and critical business outcomes across the EMEA region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager, Professional Services – EMEA, you will play a critical role in helping customers realise the full value of Black Duck solutions while shaping the future of our services organisation across Europe, the Middle East, and Africa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a geographically distributed team of highly skilled services professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence customer success at some of the world&#39;s most recognised software-driven organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the onboarding and adoption experience for customers across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across Sales, Customer Success, Technical Account Managers, Product, Support, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help execute the regional services strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable delivery models that drive both customer outcomes and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead and Develop the EMEA Services Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, inspire, and develop a high-performing team of Implementation Consultants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop team members to achieve their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, collaboration, customer focus, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support career development and skills growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build regional capabilities aligned with evolving market and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, retain, and develop top consulting talent across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deliver Exceptional Customer Outcomes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure customers achieve measurable value from their Black Duck investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee successful delivery of implementation, onboarding, advisory, and adoption services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistency in delivery methodology, quality standards, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with strategic customers and executive stakeholders to support complex programmes and critical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for significant delivery challenges and customer concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion customer success and long-term business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Drive Operational Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the operational management of the Professional Services organisation across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage resource planning, utilisation, capacity forecasting, backlog management, and delivery performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable processes, methodologies, and delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key business metrics including service delivery performance, customer satisfaction, project health, and forecasting accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve efficiency, predictability, and service quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational improvements that enable the business to scale effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Partner Across the Business&lt;/h3&gt;
